      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to call but they don't get it. they just say \"hang in there\" or \"it gets better\" but it doesn't. it’s just more of the same every single day. i'm just so exhausted. like, truly, deeply exhausted. i just want it to stop. i just want to sleep for a long time and not have to worry about any of this anymore.",
